# Fixture files for each registered adapter land here, organized by probe_id:
#
#   fixtures/PY-DESERIALIZE-001/positive.py
#   fixtures/PY-DESERIALIZE-001/negative.py
#   fixtures/PY-DESERIALIZE-001/adversarial.py   (optional)
#
# The manifest aggregator's validateFixturePaths() refuses to register an
# adapter whose declared paths don't exist on disk. The dogfood scan
# exercises every fixture: positive MUST produce >=1 finding, negative MUST
# produce 0.
